# Beginners Balaphon Tuition

We are super excited to now be able to offer beginners balaphon tuition with Nathaniel Combs. These sessions are private tuition only as we don't have enough balaphons for group classes... well not yet anyway :). The lessons will include traditional balaphon songs from West Africa played on both Malinke and Bobo balaphons. Tuition cost $60 and runs for 1 hour. Please [contact us](/contact-us/) to make a time and talk options or you can book in [online](/product-category/private-tuition-and-classes/).
